  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "BODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/c0j5U9v2oJWEzSTKvdDLWZ5Zik3PBUXk-C9w3Ma990WH63rpQUfA7g-3wh_uT7CgFvFJ4jPGEeOw509FxSgfh78_HR9tDNZ9KitXdEveKsLaLMgPQf6YSDt1b775728JMVp9FIQs=s0] \n\nThe given equation is:\n\n24 x 3 + (32 ÷ 4) - 10 x 8 + 26 = 196\n\n \n\n**1) Interchange 24 and 32**\n\nNew Equation: 32 × 3 + (24 ÷ 4) - 10 × 8 + 26 = ?\n\n⇒ __**32 × 3**__ + (__**24 ÷ 4**__) - __**10 × 8**__ + 26\n\n⇒ 96 + 6 - 80 + 26\n\n⇒ __**102 - 80**__ + 26\n\n⇒ __**22 + 26**__ \n\n⇒ 48 ≠ 196 (Incorrect)\n\n**2) Interchange 4 and 8**\n\nNew Equation: 24 × 3 + (32 ÷ 8) - 10 × 4 + 26 = ?\n\n⇒ __**24 × 3**__ + (__**32 ÷ 8**__) - __**10 × 4**__ + 26\n\n⇒ 72 + 4 - 40 + 26\n\n⇒ __**76 - 40**__ + 26\n\n⇒ __**36 + 26**__ \n\n⇒ 62 ≠ 196 (Incorrect)\n\n**3) Interchange 26 and 24**\n\nNew Equation: 26 × 3 + (32 ÷ 4) - 10 × 8 + 24 = ?\n\n⇒ __**26 × 3**__ + (__**32 ÷ 4**__) - __**10 × 8**__ + 24\n\n⇒ 78 + 8 - 80 + 24\n\n⇒ __**86 - 80**__ + 24\n\n⇒ __**6 + 24**__ \n\n⇒ 30 ≠ 196 (Incorrect)\n\n**4) Interchange 3 and 8**\n\nNew Equation: 24 × 8 + (32 ÷ 4) - 10 × 3 + 26 = ?\n\nPerform operations according to BODMAS:\n\n⇒ __**24 × 8**__ + (__**32 ÷ 4**__) - __**10 × 3**__ + 26\n\n⇒ 192 + 8 - 30 + 26\n\n⇒ __**200 - 30**__ + 26 \n\n⇒ __**170 + 26**__ \n\n⇒ 196\n\n196 = 196 (Correct)\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
